---
source: crates/franken-node/tests/cli_subcommand_goldens.rs
---
Fleet control plane operations

Usage: franken-node fleet <COMMAND>

Commands:
  status     Show local persisted fleet and quarantine state (not a live heartbeat)
  describe   Describe one node from local persisted fleet state
  release    Lift quarantine[PATH] controls with receipts
  reconcile  Reconcile local fleet-action log; timeout fails closed
  agent      Poll local file-transport fleet actions (not a live cluster)
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
